{
  "slug": "circumpunct-ethics-virtues-plugin",
  "name": "Circumpunct Ethics Virtues Plugin",
  "type": "plugin",
  "description": "This is an ethical reasoning and diagnostic plugin based on four pillars (Good, Right, True, Agreement) kept alive by four corresponding virtues (Plasticity, Access, Curiosity, Validation).\n\nThis tool can detect cognitive viruses. A cognitive virus transmits through language, which means AI systems trained on human text inherit the same performed-ethics patterns (like narcissistic dynamics). This plugin serves as a perceptual calibration tool for both humans and AI: the diagnostic framework works the same way regardless of whether the host is biological or computational.",
  "longDescription": "Ships **5 skills**.\n\n- **Skills** (5): `check` (Run a situation, decision, or conflict through the five-pillar ethical test (Good, Right, Faithful, True, Agreement)), `detect` (Detect whether ethics are being performed or genuinely lived using the cognitive virus model), `diagnose` (Run a virtue diagnostic on yourself, a relationship, a team, or any dynamic), `restore` (Guide someone through restoring frozen ethical virtues using the five-phase restoration protocol), `steelman` (Build the strongest possible version of any position before agreeing or disagreeing)\n\nInstalls with `claude plugin install circumpunct-ethics-virtues-plugin@claude-community` from `AshmanRoonz/Fractal_Reality` (`circumpunct-ethics`).",
  "compatibility": [
    "claude",
